## 🚀 Key Features (Horizon Products)

- ✅ **Merkle-Verified Licenses** – Tamper-proof and offline-capable validation.
- ✅ **ECDSA Digital Signatures** – Ensures authenticity and data integrity.
- ✅ **Direct Crypto Payments** – No intermediaries, direct settlement.
- ✅ **Offline-First Architecture** – Designed to work without constant internet access.
- ✅ **PWA Support** – Installable on both mobile and desktop devices.
- ✅ **Security-Focused Design** – Emphasis on CSP (Content Security Policy), XSS protection, and privacy-by-design principles.
- ✅ **Scalable Architecture** – Designed to accommodate large datasets and validator counts.
- ✅ **Real-Time Monitoring** – Tracks network health and validator performance.

